Comment:
 THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS. This package bundles its own Python runtime together
 with OpenCASCADE (OCCT), pythonocc-core, Qt 6 via PySide6, VTK, OpenUSD and
 others, each under its own terms -- including LGPL-2.1 (OCCT, libiconv),
 LGPL-3.0 (Qt/PySide6, pythonocc-core) and the FreeImage Public License.
 .
 The complete, generated attribution list -- naming every component, reproducing
 every license text verbatim, and carrying the LGPL written offer for source code
 -- is installed at:
 .
     /usr/share/doc/cellsmith/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
 .
 It is also inside the payload at
 /opt/cellsmith/_internal/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md. Read that file rather than this
 one for third-party terms; it is regenerated from the build environment on every
 release, whereas this file describes only CellSmith's own code.
